<title>PHILIPPINES: Matsushita 1996/97 Q2 net 196.7 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Matsushita 1996/97 Q2 net 196.7 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home appliance maker Matsushita Electric Phils Corp said on Friday it made a net income of 196.691 million pesos for the second quarter ended September, 1996.</p>
<p>The Philippine unit of Japan's Matsushita Electric Industrial Co said its net sales reached 3.189 billion pesos from July to September.</p>
<p>The company did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>In the past fiscal year ended March 31, 1996, Matsushita's Philippine unit posted a net income of 484.427 million pesos from net sales of 5.887 billion.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
